      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems reasonable, but it also seems like a workaround for a controller that claims support for multiple Phy types but doesn\u0027t really support them.\n\nCan we name it only_use_1m_phy or something like that instead?  I think that makes it more obvious what the purpose of the flag is.",
      "revId": "310c76dddbf3f3bc4af8f6bb53c490e6c767c85f",
