      "writtenOn": "2022-12-10T01:13:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As BlueZ initiates LE connection with LE 1M PHY, I think creating LE connection in this way offers better compatibility to these controllers. After connection is established, a controller might be able to switch to other PHYs with HCI_LE_Set_PHY.\n\nIn srcs/android/sysprop/BluetoothProperties.sysprop, most boolean configuration types (e.g. with the suffix .enabled) describe their intent in a positive way, like a specific feature is enabled or not. So, `init_more_phy` is more aligned to other bluetooth sysprops and its intent is also clear if readers know LE 1M phy is the default PHY to initiate. See also aosp/2335502 for more description about this sysprop.",
      "parentUuid": "9cbc9125_845b7639",
      "revId": "310c76dddbf3f3bc4af8f6bb53c490e6c767c85f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
